{"markdown":"[Skip to main content](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace#main-content)\n\n🇺🇸 Labor Day: 20% off all tests—save up to $340. Ends Sept 8.\n\n[Use code LABORDAY26](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/products/truage-truhealth)\n\n[![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5f5e7fca61ea8cbdc251e3_logo%20(1).png)![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5f9fd1ac7d6b6b1d92607a_Navigation%20Left.png)](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/)\n\nProviders\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5f845eaec253e2c5440043_iMAGE.png)\n\n[Become a Provider](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-a-provider)\n\nOur Tests\n\n[About TruAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage)\n\n[About TruHealth](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truhealth)\n\nResources\n\n[Clinical Case Studies](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/case-studies)\n\n[Report Education](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education)\n\n[Intervention Tracking](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/interventional-studies)\n\nIndividuals\n\nPatients\n\n[Shop All Tests](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront?_gl=1*179yyu7*_gcl_au*MTAzNzc0OTMwOS4xNzgzMDA4OTMwLjk2NTUwODAxLjE3ODY0NDgwMTUuMTc4NjQ0ODAxNS4xNDQzOTkwMTM5LjE3ODY0NDgwMTUuMTc4NjQ0ODAxNQ..*_ga*NTE4MjU0MTA4LjE3ODMwMDg5MzA.*_ga_1P4D1DSRZW*czE3ODY0NjUxMjMkbzQ4JGcxJHQxNzg2NDY1NDE2JGo1OSRsMCRoMCRkVnY0V2hVR200enFMcmprRzRqYU04VzN6Z3RLcDdvOWJ1QQ..*_ga_GY40ERMRF2*czE3ODY0NjUxMjMkbzQ4JGcxJHQxNzg2NDY1NDE1JGo2MCRsMCRoMA..)\n\n[![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a7b3c3f81d80e7d86c007ea_Product%20Image%20(3).png)\\\\\nTruHealth + TruAge](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truage-truhealth) [![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a7b3c51fc7c683ecdd83c2b_Product%20Image%20(1).png)\\\\\nTruHealth](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truhealth) [![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a7b3c5ae10cbb980e0fafc7_Product%20Image%20(5).png)\\\\\nTruAge](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection)\n\nPartners\n\nOur Services\n\n[Research Services](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/research-services)\n\n[Commercial Services](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/commercial-services)\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5f8f4ecd08351b44556cd3_iMAGE%20(4).png)\n\n[Work With Us](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/work-with-us-hcp)\n\nOur Science\n\nScience\n\n[Our Laboratory](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/lab-research)\n\n[What is epigenetics?](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/epigenetics-101)\n\n[Our Arrays](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/our-array-platforms)\n\n[Intervention Tracking](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/interventional-trials)\n\nAlgorithms\n\n[OMICmAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/omicmage)\n\n[SYMPHONYAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/symphony-age)\n\n[DunedinPACE](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace)\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5f9017aec253e2c55013fa_iMAGE%20(5).png)\n\n[Our Publications](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/our-publication)\n\n[Log In](https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in)\n\nProviders\n\n[Become a Provider](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-a-provider) [About TruAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage) [About TruHealth](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truhealth) [Clinical Case Studies](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/case-studies) [Report Education](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education) [Intervention Tracking](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/interventional-studies)\n\nIndividuals\n\n[Shop All Tests](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront?_gl=1*179yyu7*_gcl_au*MTAzNzc0OTMwOS4xNzgzMDA4OTMwLjk2NTUwODAxLjE3ODY0NDgwMTUuMTc4NjQ0ODAxNS4xNDQzOTkwMTM5LjE3ODY0NDgwMTUuMTc4NjQ0ODAxNQ..*_ga*NTE4MjU0MTA4LjE3ODMwMDg5MzA.*_ga_1P4D1DSRZW*czE3ODY0NjUxMjMkbzQ4JGcxJHQxNzg2NDY1NDE2JGo1OSRsMCRoMCRkVnY0V2hVR200enFMcmprRzRqYU04VzN6Z3RLcDdvOWJ1QQ..*_ga_GY40ERMRF2*czE3ODY0NjUxMjMkbzQ4JGcxJHQxNzg2NDY1NDE1JGo2MCRsMCRoMA..) [TruHealth + TruAge](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truage-truhealth) [TruHealth](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truhealth) [TruAge](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/collections/shopfront/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection)\n\nPartners\n\n[Research Services](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/research-services) [Commercial Services](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/commercial-services) [Work With Us](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/work-with-us-hcp)\n\nOur Science\n\n[Our Laboratory](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/lab-research) [Our Arrays](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/our-array-platforms) [Intervention Tracking](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/interventional-studies) [DNA Methylation](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace#) [OMICmAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/omicmage) [SYMPHONYAge](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/symphony-age) [DunedinPACE](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace) [Our Publications](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/our-publication)\n\nAGING SPEED\n\n# DunedinPACE™\n\nLearn how fast you’re aging. Unlock insights into your aging speed and how you can slow it down.\n\n[For Providers](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-a-provider) [For Individuals](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection)\n\n0.57\n\n**speed of aging**\n\nDEVELOPED WITH DUKE\n\n## Understand Your Aging Speed\n\nOur DunedinPACE science, developed with Duke, measures how quickly your body ages over time. By monitoring whether your aging speed is accelerating or decelerating, you can measure the effect of various lifestyle changes. Your aging speed, combined with your biological age, empowers you to take proactive steps to optimize your health.\n\n[Download TruAge Sample Report](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/684b0280d60621d1be91641c_ExampleAdvancedTruAge.pdf)\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a6907a37995be283ce13f41_dunedinpacedoc.png)\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a68c20a2850fda8b0d0c260_Image.png)\n\n## Is Your Lifestyle Slowing Your Aging Speed?\n\nThe DunedinPACE report lets you see the real impact of your lifestyle choices on your aging process. Whether it’s diet, exercise, or sleep, our test provides concrete data on how these factors influence your pace of aging. Routine testing allows you to quickly measure the effects of your habits.\n\n[Purchase Test Kit](https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection)\n\nWhy Physicians Trust DunedinPACETM\n\nExplore core diagnostics, reporting tools, and research platforms trusted by leading clinicians and scientists.\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1854d3119cab63a7340251_Icon.png)\n\n#### Real-Time Feedback\n\nQuickly see the results of your lifestyle changes.\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a18548e3598132e63398e58_Icon.png)\n\n#### Advanced Technology\n\nThe only third-generation biological clock aging algorithm available.\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1854a7e26efe4dccbed63f_Icon.png)\n\n#### Accurate & Sensitive\n\nDetect subtle changes in your aging process.\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1854bdd3521b59039b09af_Icon.png)\n\n#### Comprehensive Reports\n\nGet detailed insights into your biological responsiveness, lifestyle, and more.\n\nBERLIN AGING STUDY II\n\n## DunedinPACE is the strongest individual predictor of all-cause mortality.\n\nIn a 7.4-year study of 1,083 older adults, our pace of aging clock outperformed 14 leading longevity biomarkers — including inflammation markers, grip strength, and cognitive tests.\n\n[Read the Research](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41792861/)\n\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1855874d077d020528d132_Image.png)\n\nAbout\n\n[About Us](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-us) [Help Center](https://trudiagnostic.my.site.com/support/s/?language=en_US) [Careers](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/careers) [Newsletter](https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/subscribe?a=LmGkBQ&g=W7Xgyt)\n\nPartners\n\n[Become a Provider](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-a-provider) [Become an Affiliate](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-an-affiliate) [Research Services](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/research-services) [Requisition Form](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/requisition-form) [API Reference](https://trudiagnostic.notion.site/Tru-Diagnostic-v2-API-100865e61b7e803fa038dee5e55e6cc2)\n\nMembers\n\n[Log In](https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in) [Register My Kit](https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/registration) [View My Reports](https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in) [Return Policy](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/return-and-refund-policy)\n\nCONTACT\n\n[881 Corporate Dr. \\\\\n\\\\\nLexington, KY 40503](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace#)\n\n[(888) 909-3634](tel:+18889093634)\n\nMon-Fri 9am-7pm \\| Sat 9am-3pm\n\nEastern Time (UTC-4:00)\n\n[support@trudiagnostic.com](mailto:support@trudiagnostic.com)\n\nDNAm biomarker outputs are intended to support, not replace, clinical judgment. They should be interpreted within the full clinical context, including history, physical examination, conventional laboratory testing, and imaging studies where clinically indicated. They should not be used as the sole basis for diagnosis or treatment decisions.\n\n[Terms of Service](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/terms-of-service) [Privacy Policy](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/privacy-policy) [FCIO Policy](https://www.trudiagnostic.com/fcoi-policy)\n\n© TruDiagnostic 2026, All Rights Reserved","rawHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><!-- Last Published: Fri Sep 04 2026 21:11:19 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Univ