agnostic_image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1855874d077d020528d132_Image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"diagnostic_img\"></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"footer below-fold\"><div class=\"footer-new\"><div class=\"padding-global padding-section-footer\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"footer_wrapper new\"><div class=\"footer_top new\"><div class=\"footer-new_col\"><div class=\"footer-new_col-title\">About</div><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-us\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">About Us</a><a href=\"https://trudiagnostic.my.site.com/support/s/?language=en_US\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Help Center</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/careers\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Careers</a><a href=\"https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/subscribe?a=LmGkBQ&amp;g=W7Xgyt\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Newsletter</a></div><div class=\"footer-new_col\"><div class=\"footer-new_col-title\">Partners</div><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-a-provider\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Become a Provider</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/become-an-affiliate\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Become an Affiliate</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/research-services\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Research Services</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/requisition-form\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Requisition Form</a><a href=\"https://trudiagnostic.notion.site/Tru-Diagnostic-v2-API-100865e61b7e803fa038dee5e55e6cc2\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">API Reference</a></div><div class=\"footer-new_col\"><div class=\"footer-new_col-title\">Members</div><a href=\"https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Log In</a><a href=\"https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/registration\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Register My Kit</a><a href=\"https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">View My Reports</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/return-and-refund-policy\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Return Policy</a></div><div class=\"footer-new_col\"><div class=\"footer-new_col-title\">CONTACT</div><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace#\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">881 Corporate Dr. <br>Lexington, KY 40503</a><div class=\"footer-new_col-flex\"><a href=\"tel:+18889093634\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">(888) 909-3634</a><div id=\"standartTime\" class=\"footer-span\">Mon-Fri 9am-7pm | Sat 9am-3pm<br>Eastern Time (UTC-4:00)</div></div><a href=\"mailto:support@trudiagnostic.com\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">support@trudiagnostic.com</a></div></div><div class=\"footer_bot new\"><div class=\"footer-span\">DNAm biomarker outputs are intended to support, not replace, clinical judgment. They should be interpreted within the full clinical context, including history, physical examination, conventional laboratory testing, and imaging studies where clinically indicated. They should not be used as the sole basis for diagnosis or treatment decisions.</div></div><div class=\"footer_copyright\"><div class=\"footer_copyright-left\"><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/terms-of-service\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Terms of Service</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/privacy-policy\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">Privacy Policy</a><a href=\"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/fcoi-policy\" class=\"footer-new_col-item\">FCIO Policy</a></div><div class=\"footer-span\">© TruDiagnostic 2026, All Rights Reserved</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"footer_code w-embed w-script\"><script>\n(function() {\n  function getEasternUtcOffset() {\n    const now = new Date();\n    const utcDate = new Date(now.toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'UTC' }));\n    const nyDate = new Date(now.toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'America/New_York' }));\n    return Math.round((utcDate - nyDate) / (1000 * 60 * 60)); // 5 = EST, 4 = EDT\n  }\n\n  function updateStandardTimeLabel() {\n    var el = document.getElementById('standartTime');\n    if (!el) return;\n\n    var offset = getEasternUtcOffset();\n    var tzLabel = offset === 4\n      ? 'Eastern Time (UTC-4:00)'\n      : 'Eastern Time (UTC-5:00)';\n\n    el.innerHTML = 'Mon-Fri 9am-7pm | Sat 9am-3pm<br>' + tzLabel;\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', updateStandardTimeLabel);\n  // На випадок, якщо DOMContentLoaded вже відбувся до виконання embed-скрипта\n  if (document.readyState === 'complete' || document.readyState === 'interactive') {\n    updateStandardTimeLabel();\n  }\n})();\n</script></div></footer></main></div><script src=\"https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/js/trud-website.c494d4ee.c847cbd20b43fc73.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-YwFaqSIMY+rqDVpb/bd/X9J+PwgaYcjXWj9GULIYztrYrzQp3kHck3w57hxi9nkS\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><!-- ===========================\n     GLOBAL & HERO CSS (merged)\n=========================== -->\n\n\n<!-- ===========================\n     GTM NOSCRIPT (keep)\n=========================== -->\n<noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-5NZQZLP\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n\n<!-- Pinterest Tag -->\n<script>\n!function(e){if(!window.pintrk){window.pintrk = function () {\nwindow.pintrk.queue.push(Array.prototype.slice.call(arguments))};var\n  n=window.pintrk;n.queue=[],n.version=\"3.0\";var\n  t=document.createElement(\"script\");t.async=!0,t.src=e;var\n  r=document.getElementsByTagName(\"script\")[0];\n  r.parentNode.insertBefore(t,r)}}(\"https://s.pinimg.com/ct/core.js\");\n\npintrk('load', '2613101028583');\npintrk('page');\n</script>\n<noscript>\n<img